enile erection in castrated rats after sleep deprivation and cocaine</article-title><source>J Neuroendocrinol</source><year>2004</year><volume>16</volume><fpage>154</fpage><lpage>159</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14764002</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1111/j.0953-8194.2004.01145.x</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B11"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Andersen</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>Antunes</surname><given-names>IB</given-names></name><name><surname>Tufik</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effects of paradoxical sleep deprivation on genital reflexes in five rat strains</article-title><source>Horm Beh</source><year>2006</year><volume>49</volume><fpage>173</fpage><lpage>180</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.yhbeh.2005.05.021</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Andersen</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>Tufik</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Effects of progesterone blockade over cocaine-induced genital reflexes of paradoxical sleep deprived male rats</article-title><source>Horm Beh</source><year>2005</year><volume>47</volume><fpage>477</fpage><lpage>484</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.yhbeh.2004.12.005</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Lal</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Laryea</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name><name><surname>Thavundayil</surname><given-names>JX</given-names></name><name><surname>Nair</surname><given-names>NP</given-names></name><name><surname>Negrete</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Ackman</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Blundell</surname><given-names>